learnings:
  - 'Early scout epiphany: every harness is converging on plugins+skills+hooks+subagents+worktrees+MCP; the open gaps (merging parallel work, loop governance, memory validation, cross-harness identity) are exactly what Warpline, neurons and the calibration loop already target.'
  - deepseek-harness explicitly refuses to merge or adjudicate parallel work ("False mutual exclusion is more dangerous than an explicit warning") — the gap Warpline is built for.
